      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p>For the most popular tenure — 5 years — the Post Office TD at 7.5% comfortably beats SBI (6.5%) and ICICI (6.9%), and edges ahead of HDFC (7.0%) as well. The gap widens further when you factor in the sovereign guarantee, which no private or public sector bank can match.</p>

